## Stack

React + Vite + TypeScript, validated by the full ai-guardrails suite:
prettier, oxlint, tsc, semgrep, codespell, an oxlint
security pass, knip, dependency-cruiser, Vitest (+{{coverage_threshold}}%
coverage), Playwright, and npm audit.

## Prerequisites

- Node.js {{node_version}}+ and npm
- [just](https://github.com/casey/just#installation)
- codespell (`brew install codespell`)
- semgrep (`brew install semgrep`)

## Quickstart

    just init     # install dependencies + Playwright browser
    just run      # start the Vite dev server
    just ci       # run every validation check

## Commands

Run `just` (or `just help`) for the full annotated list. The most important:

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `just init` | Install dependencies and the Playwright Chromium browser |
| `just run` | Start the Vite dev server |
| `just build` | Type-check and build for production |
| `just code-format` | Auto-format with prettier |
| `just code-style` | prettier --check + oxlint --deny-warnings |
| `just code-semgrep` | Custom guardrail rules (no suppression, no silent defaults, …) |
| `just code-lspchecks` | tsc over app, node, and e2e configs |
| `just code-security` | Oxlint security pass |
| `just code-deptry` | knip dependency hygiene |
| `just code-architecture` | dependency-cruiser import rules |
| `just code-audit` | npm audit + outdated report |
| `just test` / `just test-coverage` | Vitest (with {{coverage_threshold}}% threshold) |
| `just test-e2e` | Playwright against the built app |
| `just ci` / `just ci-quiet` | Everything, fail-fast |

## Project Layout

    src/            application code + colocated *.test.tsx unit tests
    e2e/            Playwright tests
    scripts/        utility scripts
    data/input/     input data
    data/output/    output data
    config/         semgrep, codespell, oxlint-security configuration

## Conventions

See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) — fail fast, no default values, no suppression
annotations, npm-only tooling.
